{"product_id":"royal-eclipse-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt","title":"Maple x Spalted Tamarind 12 pointer (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp\u003e Crafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium figured Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue features \u003cstrong\u003espalted tamarind points\u003c\/strong\u003e accented with \u003cstrong\u003epurple veneers\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a striking contrast that highlights the natural beauty of both woods. Finished with a \u003cstrong\u003eblack crocodile-embossed leather wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e, it offers a luxurious feel and a secure, comfortable grip.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery Cues Master cue is handcrafted with precision and attention to detail, ensuring each piece is as unique as the player who owns it. Whether paired with your favorite shaft for competitive play or displayed as part of a premium collection, the \u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Eclipse\u003c\/strong\u003e delivers the perfect balance of beauty, craftsmanship, and performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Figured Canadian Maple with Spalted Tamarind Points and Purple Veneers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black Crocodile-Embossed Leather\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Figured Canadian Maple with Spalted Tamarind Points and Purple Veneers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for players who appreciate understated luxury, the \u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Eclipse\u003c\/strong\u003e combines premium materials with expert craftsmanship. The figured maple, distinctive spalted tamarind, and bold purple veneers create a cue that is both visually captivating and built for lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHandcrafted with precision. Built to perform. Designed to be remembered.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453158522928,"sku":null,"price":20000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/a5426051-3320-4f34-9bcd-7641225901d1.png?v=1785641669","url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/products\/royal-eclipse-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt","provider":"Cues Master Shop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}